# {{ distribution }}

{{ vendor_name }} adapter for MowDeck: a cloud provider plugin ([ADR 0066](../../docs/adr/0066-cloud-provider-plugins-and-more-vendors.md)) with its connection and its error lexicon ([ADR 0067](../../docs/adr/0067-error-code-lexicon.md)). **Untested on real hardware**, off by default: operators enable it with `MOWDECK_CLOUD_PROVIDERS_ENABLE={{ vendor }}`.

Generated from `templates/provider` ([ADR 0069](../../docs/adr/0069-provider-conformance-kit-and-package-template.md)); the step-by-step guide is [Adding a provider](../../docs/dev/adding-a-provider.md).

